[{"id":"khalaqa-2-29-2","words":["verb:khalaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"stvorio je","en":"he/it created"},{"bs":"stvorili smo vas","en":"we created you (all)"},{"bs":"stvorio ga je","en":"he created him"},{"bs":"i stvara","en":"and he/it creates"}],"ref":"2:29","answerWord":"خَلَقَ","answerSound":"audio/98ec23acf9d481a799d4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He it is Who created for you all that is in the earth. Then turned He to the heaven, and fashioned it as seven heavens. And He is knower of all things.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stvoriti","en":"to create"},"passage":["هُوَ","ٱلَّذِى","خَلَقَ","لَكُم","مَّا","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","جَمِيعًا","ثُمَّ","ٱسْتَوَىٰٓ","إِلَى","ٱلسَّمَآءِ","فَسَوَّىٰهُنَّ","سَبْعَ","سَمَٰوَٰتٍ","وَهُوَ","بِكُلِّ","شَىْءٍ","عَلِيمٌ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"خَلَقَ"}},{"id":"khalaqa-15-26-1","words":["verb:khalaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"stvorili smo","en":"we created"},{"bs":"stvara","en":"he/it creates"},{"bs":"stvorio si ga","en":"you created him"},{"bs":"stvorena je","en":"she/it was created"}],"ref":"15:26","answerWord":"خَلَقْنَا","answerSound":"audio/a13ccb3257cb29b01342.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Verily We created man of potter's clay of black mud altered,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stvoriti","en":"to create"},"passage":["وَلَقَدْ","خَلَقْنَا","ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ","مِن","صَلْصَٰلٍ","مِّنْ","حَمَإٍ","مَّسْنُونٍ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"خَلَقَ"}},{"id":"khalaqa-7-191-3","words":["verb:khalaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"stvara","en":"he/it creates"},{"bs":"stvaramo vas","en":"we create you (all)"},{"bs":"stvorili su","en":"they created"},{"bs":"stvorili smo","en":"we created"}],"ref":"7:191","answerWord":"يَخْلُقُ","answerSound":"audio/ba1160f9d72e567d258f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Attribute they as partners to Allah those who created naught, but are themselves created,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stvoriti","en":"to create"},"passage":["أَيُشْرِكُونَ","مَا","لَا","يَخْلُقُ","شَيْـًٔا","وَهُمْ","يُخْلَقُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"خَلَقَ"}},{"id":"khalaqa-71-14-1","words":["verb:khalaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"stvorio vas je","en":"He created you"},{"bs":"i stvorili smo vas","en":"and we created you (all)"},{"bs":"stvorio me je","en":"he/it created me"},{"bs":"stvorili smo ih","en":"we created them (two)"}],"ref":"71:14","answerWord":"خَلَقَكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/fe78c8f1133896d116eb.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"When He created you by (divers) stages?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stvoriti","en":"to create"},"passage":["وَقَدْ","خَلَقَكُمْ","أَطْوَارًا"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"خَلَقَ"}},{"id":"khalaqa-4-1-5","words":["verb:khalaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"stvorio vas je","en":"he/it created you (all)"},{"bs":"stvorili smo ih","en":"we created them"},{"bs":"stvorio te je","en":"he/it created you"},{"bs":"stvara","en":"he/it creates"}],"ref":"4:1","answerWord":"خَلَقَكُم","answerSound":"audio/71e1941be9900a0a7807.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O mankind! Be careful of your duty to your Lord Who created you from a single soul and from it created its mate and from them twain hath spread abroad a multitude of men and women. Be careful of your duty toward Allah in Whom ye claim (your rights) of one another, and toward the wombs (that bare you). Lo! Allah hath been a watcher over you.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stvoriti","en":"to create"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلنَّاسُ","ٱتَّقُوا۟","رَبَّكُمُ","ٱلَّذِى","خَلَقَكُم","مِّن","نَّفْسٍ","وَٰحِدَةٍ","وَخَلَقَ","مِنْهَا","زَوْجَهَا","وَبَثَّ","مِنْهُمَا","رِجَالًا","كَثِيرًا","وَنِسَآءً","وَٱتَّقُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","ٱلَّذِى","تَسَآءَلُونَ","بِهِۦ","وَٱلْأَرْحَامَ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","كَانَ","عَلَيْكُمْ","رَقِيبًا"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"خَلَقَ"}},{"id":"khalaqa-56-57-1","words":["verb:khalaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"stvorili smo vas","en":"we created you (all)"},{"bs":"stvoren je","en":"he/it was created"},{"bs":"stvorio sam te","en":"I created you"},{"bs":"stvaraju","en":"they create"}],"ref":"56:57","answerWord":"خَلَقْنَٰكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/dce7ae39a148b3f02e05.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"We created you. Will ye then admit the truth?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stvoriti","en":"to create"},"passage":["نَحْنُ","خَلَقْنَٰكُمْ","فَلَوْلَا","تُصَدِّقُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"خَلَقَ"}},{"id":"khalaqa-4-1-9","words":["verb:khalaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"i stvorio je","en":"and he/it created"},{"bs":"stvaramo vas","en":"we create you (all)"},{"bs":"bivaju stvoreni","en":"they are created"},{"bs":"stvara vas","en":"he/it creates you (all)"}],"ref":"4:1","answerWord":"وَخَلَقَ","answerSound":"audio/c7a40cb253ea4d5d04ca.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O mankind! Be careful of your duty to your Lord Who created you from a single soul and from it created its mate and from them twain hath spread abroad a multitude of men and women. Be careful of your duty toward Allah in Whom ye claim (your rights) of one another, and toward the wombs (that bare you). Lo! Allah hath been a watcher over you.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stvoriti","en":"to create"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلنَّاسُ","ٱتَّقُوا۟","رَبَّكُمُ","ٱلَّذِى","خَلَقَكُم","مِّن","نَّفْسٍ","وَٰحِدَةٍ","وَخَلَقَ","مِنْهَا","زَوْجَهَا","وَبَثَّ","مِنْهُمَا","رِجَالًا","كَثِيرًا","وَنِسَآءً","وَٱتَّقُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","ٱلَّذِى","تَسَآءَلُونَ","بِهِۦ","وَٱلْأَرْحَامَ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","كَانَ","عَلَيْكُمْ","رَقِيبًا"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"خَلَقَ"}},{"id":"khalaqa-3-59-7","words":["verb:khalaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"stvorio ga je","en":"he created him"},{"bs":"stvorio si me","en":"you created me"},{"bs":"stvorio ih je","en":"he/it created them"},{"bs":"stvorio je","en":"he/it created"}],"ref":"3:59","answerWord":"خَلَقَهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/298d439fc8854c4340b6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! the likeness of Jesus with Allah is as the likeness of Adam. He created him of dust, then He said unto him: Be! and he is.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stvoriti","en":"to create"},"passage":["إِنَّ","مَثَلَ","عِيسَىٰ","عِندَ","ٱللَّهِ","كَمَثَلِ","ءَادَمَ","خَلَقَهُۥ","مِن","تُرَابٍ","ثُمَّ","قَالَ","لَهُۥ","كُن","فَيَكُونُ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"خَلَقَ"}},{"id":"khalaqa-52-36-1","words":["verb:khalaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"stvorili su","en":"they created"},{"bs":"pa smo stvorili","en":"so we created"},{"bs":"stvorio si me","en":"you created me"},{"bs":"stvaraju","en":"they create"}],"ref":"52:36","answerWord":"خَلَقُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/2630d96ea9addff2a392.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Or did they create the heavens and the earth? Nay, but they are sure of nothing!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stvoriti","en":"to create"},"passage":["أَمْ","خَلَقُوا۟","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلْأَرْضَ","بَل","لَّا","يُوقِنُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"خَلَقَ"}},{"id":"khalaqa-15-27-1","words":["verb:khalaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"stvorili smo ih","en":"we created them"},{"bs":"stvorili smo vas","en":"we created you (all)"},{"bs":"stvarate li ga","en":"do you create it"},{"bs":"bivaju stvoreni","en":"they are created"}],"ref":"15:27","answerWord":"خَلَقْنَٰهُ","answerSound":"audio/c91adb98420b3826b95e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And the jinn did We create aforetime of essential fire.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stvoriti","en":"to create"},"passage":["وَٱلْجَآنَّ","خَلَقْنَٰهُ","مِن","قَبْلُ","مِن","نَّارِ","ٱلسَّمُومِ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"خَلَقَ"}},{"id":"khalaqa-21-37-0","words":["verb:khalaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"stvoren je","en":"he/it was created"},{"bs":"i stvorili smo","en":"and we created"},{"bs":"i stvara","en":"and he/it creates"},{"bs":"stvorili smo ih","en":"we created them"}],"ref":"21:37","answerWord":"خُلِقَ","answerSound":"audio/458c39cb2007282b1204.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Man is made of haste. I shall show you My portents, but ask Me not to hasten.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stvoriti","en":"to create"},"passage":["خُلِقَ","ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ","مِنْ","عَجَلٍ","سَأُو۟رِيكُمْ","ءَايَٰتِى","فَلَا","تَسْتَعْجِلُونِ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"خَلَقَ"}},{"id":"khalaqa-7-181-1","words":["verb:khalaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"stvorili smo","en":"we created"},{"bs":"stvorio vas je","en":"He created you"},{"bs":"stvoreni su","en":"they were created"},{"bs":"stvorio me je","en":"he/it created me"}],"ref":"7:181","answerWord":"خَلَقْنَآ","answerSound":"audio/215383db719e4f202f3d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And of those whom We created there is a nation who guide with the Truth and establish justice therewith.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stvoriti","en":"to create"},"passage":["وَمِمَّنْ","خَلَقْنَآ","أُمَّةٌ","يَهْدُونَ","بِٱلْحَقِّ","وَبِهِۦ","يَعْدِلُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"خَلَقَ"}},{"id":"khalaqa-7-191-6","words":["verb:khalaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"bivaju stvoreni","en":"they are created"},{"bs":"i stvoren je","en":"and he/it was created"},{"bs":"stvorio vas je","en":"he/it created you (all)"},{"bs":"pa smo stvorili","en":"so we created"}],"ref":"7:191","answerWord":"يُخْلَقُونَ","answerSound":"audio/27194aca2521988ceb6f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Attribute they as partners to Allah those who created naught, but are themselves created,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stvoriti","en":"to create"},"passage":["أَيُشْرِكُونَ","مَا","لَا","يَخْلُقُ","شَيْـًٔا","وَهُمْ","يُخْلَقُونَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"خَلَقَ"}},{"id":"khalaqa-11-119-5","words":["verb:khalaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"stvorio ih je","en":"he/it created them"},{"bs":"stvorio me je","en":"he/it created me"},{"bs":"stvorio je","en":"he/it created"},{"bs":"stvorio sam te","en":"I created you"}],"ref":"11:119","answerWord":"خَلَقَهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/15428516d96a1840e2c5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Save him on whom thy Lord hath mercy; and for that He did create them. And the Word of thy Lord hath been fulfilled: Verily I shall fill hell with the jinn and mankind together.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stvoriti","en":"to create"},"passage":["إِلَّا","مَن","رَّحِمَ","رَبُّكَ","وَلِذَٰلِكَ","خَلَقَهُمْ","وَتَمَّتْ","كَلِمَةُ","رَبِّكَ","لَأَمْلَأَنَّ","جَهَنَّمَ","مِنَ","ٱلْجِنَّةِ","وَٱلنَّاسِ","أَجْمَعِينَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"خَلَقَ"}},{"id":"khalaqa-38-75-7","words":["verb:khalaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"stvorio sam","en":"I created"},{"bs":"stvorili smo ih","en":"we created them"},{"bs":"stvaramo vas","en":"we create you (all)"},{"bs":"i stvarate","en":"and you (all) create"}],"ref":"38:75","answerWord":"خَلَقْتُ","answerSound":"audio/c3dd6bdd3187b9d0c085.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: O Iblis! What hindereth thee from falling prostrate before that which I have created with both My hands? Art thou too proud or art thou of the high exalted?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stvoriti","en":"to create"},"passage":["قَالَ","يَٰٓإِبْلِيسُ","مَا","مَنَعَكَ","أَن","تَسْجُدَ","لِمَا","خَلَقْتُ","بِيَدَىَّ","أَسْتَكْبَرْتَ","أَمْ","كُنتَ","مِنَ","ٱلْعَالِينَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"خَلَقَ"}},{"id":"khalaqa-3-191-14","words":["verb:khalaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"stvorio si","en":"you created"},{"bs":"stvorio vas je","en":"He created you"},{"bs":"i stvarate","en":"and you (all) create"},{"bs":"stvorio sam te","en":"I created you"}],"ref":"3:191","answerWord":"خَلَقْتَ","answerSound":"audio/2af5a994d165af632aa5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Such as remember Allah, standing, sitting, and reclining, and consider the creation of the heavens and the earth, (and say): Our Lord! Thou createdst not this in vain. Glory be to Thee! Preserve us from the doom of Fire.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stvoriti","en":"to create"},"passage":["ٱلَّذِينَ","يَذْكُرُونَ","ٱللَّهَ","قِيَٰمًا","وَقُعُودًا","وَعَلَىٰ","جُنُوبِهِمْ","وَيَتَفَكَّرُونَ","فِى","خَلْقِ","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلْأَرْضِ","رَبَّنَا","مَا","خَلَقْتَ","هَٰذَا","بَٰطِلًا","سُبْحَٰنَكَ","فَقِنَا","عَذَابَ","ٱلنَّارِ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"خَلَقَ"}},{"id":"khalaqa-7-12-11","words":["verb:khalaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"stvorio si me","en":"you created me"},{"bs":"i stvorili smo vas","en":"and we created you (all)"},{"bs":"pa je stvorio","en":"so he/it created"},{"bs":"stvorili smo","en":"we created"}],"ref":"7:12","answerWord":"خَلَقْتَنِى","answerSound":"audio/a73c504aad256d6a5cc8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: What hindered thee that thou didst not fall prostrate when I bade thee? (Iblis) said: I am better than him. Thou createdst me of fire while him Thou didst create of mud.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stvoriti","en":"to create"},"passage":["قَالَ","مَا","مَنَعَكَ","أَلَّا","تَسْجُدَ","إِذْ","أَمَرْتُكَ","قَالَ","أَنَا۠","خَيْرٌ","مِّنْهُ","خَلَقْتَنِى","مِن","نَّارٍ","وَخَلَقْتَهُۥ","مِن","طِينٍ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"خَلَقَ"}},{"id":"khalaqa-7-12-14","words":["verb:khalaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"i stvorio si ga","en":"and you created him"},{"bs":"stvorio ih je","en":"he/it created them"},{"bs":"stvoreni su","en":"they were created"},{"bs":"stvorili su","en":"they created"}],"ref":"7:12","answerWord":"وَخَلَقْتَهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/6c72ef18856e8fcc0fa9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: What hindered thee that thou didst not fall prostrate when I bade thee? (Iblis) said: I am better than him. Thou createdst me of fire while him Thou didst create of mud.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stvoriti","en":"to create"},"passage":["قَالَ","مَا","مَنَعَكَ","أَلَّا","تَسْجُدَ","إِذْ","أَمَرْتُكَ","قَالَ","أَنَا۠","خَيْرٌ","مِّنْهُ","خَلَقْتَنِى","مِن","نَّارٍ","وَخَلَقْتَهُۥ","مِن","طِينٍ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"خَلَقَ"}},{"id":"khalaqa-16-20-6","words":["verb:khalaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"stvaraju","en":"they create"},{"bs":"stvorili smo","en":"we created"},{"bs":"pa je stvorio","en":"so he/it created"},{"bs":"stvorili su","en":"they created"}],"ref":"16:20","answerWord":"يَخْلُقُونَ","answerSound":"audio/8ab9146c412bf3c12255.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those unto whom they cry beside Allah created naught, but are themselves created.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stvoriti","en":"to create"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","يَدْعُونَ","مِن","دُونِ","ٱللَّهِ","لَا","يَخْلُقُونَ","شَيْـًٔا","وَهُمْ","يُخْلَقُونَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"خَلَقَ"}},{"id":"khalaqa-17-99-11","words":["verb:khalaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"stvara","en":"he/it creates"},{"bs":"stvorio te je","en":"he/it created you"},{"bs":"i stvorili smo vas","en":"and we created you (all)"},{"bs":"stvorio je","en":"he/it created"}],"ref":"17:99","answerWord":"يَخْلُقَ","answerSound":"audio/9baed3c76e8543bc5ce4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Have they not seen that Allah Who created the heavens and the earth is Able to create the like of them, and hath appointed for them an end whereof there is no doubt? But the wrong-doers refuse aught save disbelief.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stvoriti","en":"to create"},"passage":["أَوَلَمْ","يَرَوْا۟","أَنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","ٱلَّذِى","خَلَقَ","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلْأَرْضَ","قَادِرٌ","عَلَىٰٓ","أَن","يَخْلُقَ","مِثْلَهُمْ","وَجَعَلَ","لَهُمْ","أَجَلًا","لَّا","رَيْبَ","فِيهِ","فَأَبَى","ٱلظَّٰلِمُونَ","إِلَّا","كُفُورًا"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"خَلَقَ"}},{"id":"kallama-2-174-20","words":["verb:kallama"],"options":[{"bs":"govori im","en":"he/it speaks to them"},{"bs":"obraćajte Mi se","en":"speak to Me"},{"bs":"i govorio im je","en":"and he/it spoke to them"},{"bs":"i govorio je","en":"and he/it spoke"}],"ref":"2:174","answerWord":"يُكَلِّمُهُمُ","answerSound":"audio/6a090e7ee27e70fcb5e1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! those who hide aught of the Scripture which Allah hath revealed and purchase a small gain therewith, they eat into their bellies nothing else than fire. Allah will not speak to them on the Day of Resurrection, nor will He make them grow. Theirs will be a painful doom.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"govoriti, obratiti se","en":"to speak to"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","يَكْتُمُونَ","مَآ","أَنزَلَ","ٱللَّهُ","مِنَ","ٱلْكِتَٰبِ","وَيَشْتَرُونَ","بِهِۦ","ثَمَنًا","قَلِيلًا","أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","مَا","يَأْكُلُونَ","فِى","بُطُونِهِمْ","إِلَّا","ٱلنَّارَ","وَلَا","يُكَلِّمُهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","يَوْمَ","ٱلْقِيَٰمَةِ","وَلَا","يُزَكِّيهِمْ","وَلَهُمْ","عَذَابٌ","أَلِيمٌ"],"marked":[20],"facts":{"verb":"كَلَّمَ"}},{"id":"kallama-2-118-5","words":["verb:kallama"],"options":[{"bs":"govori nam","en":"he/it speaks to us"},{"bs":"govorim","en":"I speak"},{"bs":"govorio mu je","en":"he/it spoke to him"},{"bs":"govori im","en":"he/it speaks to them"}],"ref":"2:118","answerWord":"يُكَلِّمُنَا","answerSound":"audio/46668df01bd38b5cb477.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And those who have no knowledge say: Why doth not Allah speak unto us, or some sign come unto us? Even thus, as they now speak, spake those (who were) before them. Their hearts are all alike. We have made clear the revelations for people who are sure.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"govoriti, obratiti se","en":"to speak to"},"passage":["وَقَالَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","لَا","يَعْلَمُونَ","لَوْلَا","يُكَلِّمُنَا","ٱللَّهُ","أَوْ","تَأْتِينَآ","ءَايَةٌ","كَذَٰلِكَ","قَالَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","مِن","قَبْلِهِم","مِّثْلَ","قَوْلِهِمْ","تَشَٰبَهَتْ","قُلُوبُهُمْ","قَدْ","بَيَّنَّا","ٱلْءَايَٰتِ","لِقَوْمٍ","يُوقِنُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"كَلَّمَ"}},{"id":"kallama-3-46-0","words":["verb:kallama"],"options":[{"bs":"i govori","en":"and he/it speaks"},{"bs":"i govorio je","en":"and he/it spoke"},{"bs":"govorimo","en":"we speak"},{"bs":"govori im","en":"he/it speaks to them"}],"ref":"3:46","answerWord":"وَيُكَلِّمُ","answerSound":"audio/49b6a33586e6c14818e7.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He will speak unto mankind in his cradle and in his manhood, and he is of the righteous.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"govoriti, obratiti se","en":"to speak to"},"passage":["وَيُكَلِّمُ","ٱلنَّاسَ","فِى","ٱلْمَهْدِ","وَكَهْلًا","وَمِنَ","ٱلصَّٰلِحِينَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"كَلَّمَ"}},{"id":"kallama-4-164-10","words":["verb:kallama"],"options":[{"bs":"i govorio je","en":"and he/it spoke"},{"bs":"govorim","en":"I speak"},{"bs":"govori mu","en":"he/it speaks to him"},{"bs":"govori nam","en":"he/it speaks to us"}],"ref":"4:164","answerWord":"وَكَلَّمَ","answerSound":"audio/2023a7808c297d64cc2e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And messengers We have mentioned unto thee before and messengers We have not mentioned unto thee; and Allah spake directly unto Moses;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"govoriti, obratiti se","en":"to speak to"},"passage":["وَرُسُلًا","قَدْ","قَصَصْنَٰهُمْ","عَلَيْكَ","مِن","قَبْلُ","وَرُسُلًا","لَّمْ","نَقْصُصْهُمْ","عَلَيْكَ","وَكَلَّمَ","ٱللَّهُ","مُوسَىٰ","تَكْلِيمًا"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"كَلَّمَ"}},{"id":"kallama-6-111-5","words":["verb:kallama"],"options":[{"bs":"i govorio im je","en":"and he/it spoke to them"},{"bs":"govori mu","en":"he/it speaks to him"},{"bs":"govori nam","en":"he/it speaks to us"},{"bs":"oslovljen je","en":"he/it was spoken to"}],"ref":"6:111","answerWord":"وَكَلَّمَهُمُ","answerSound":"audio/9652161b7ce8efa15ad1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And though We should send down the angels unto them, and the dead should speak unto them, and We should gather against them all things in array, they would not believe unless Allah so willed. Howbeit, most of them are ignorant.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"govoriti, obratiti se","en":"to speak to"},"passage":["وَلَوْ","أَنَّنَا","نَزَّلْنَآ","إِلَيْهِمُ","ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةَ","وَكَلَّمَهُمُ","ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ","وَحَشَرْنَا","عَلَيْهِمْ","كُلَّ","شَىْءٍ","قُبُلًا","مَّا","كَانُوا۟","لِيُؤْمِنُوٓا۟","إِلَّآ","أَن","يَشَآءَ","ٱللَّهُ","وَلَٰكِنَّ","أَكْثَرَهُمْ","يَجْهَلُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"كَلَّمَ"}},{"id":"kallama-7-148-15","words":["verb:kallama"],"options":[{"bs":"govori im","en":"he/it speaks to them"},{"bs":"i govorio je","en":"and he/it spoke"},{"bs":"govori nam","en":"he/it speaks to us"},{"bs":"govorimo","en":"we speak"}],"ref":"7:148","answerWord":"يُكَلِّمُهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/a43fb726e1766c6c1342.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And the folk of Moses, after (he left them), chose a calf (for worship), (made) out of their ornaments, of saffron hue, which gave a lowing sound. Saw they not that it spake not unto them nor guided them to any way? They chose it, and became wrong-doers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"govoriti, obratiti se","en":"to speak to"},"passage":["وَٱتَّخَذَ","قَوْمُ","مُوسَىٰ","مِنۢ","بَعْدِهِۦ","مِنْ","حُلِيِّهِمْ","عِجْلًا","جَسَدًا","لَّهُۥ","خُوَارٌ","أَلَمْ","يَرَوْا۟","أَنَّهُۥ","لَا","يُكَلِّمُهُمْ","وَلَا","يَهْدِيهِمْ","سَبِيلًا","ٱتَّخَذُوهُ","وَكَانُوا۟","ظَٰلِمِينَ"],"marked":[15],"facts":{"verb":"كَلَّمَ"}},{"id":"kallama-12-54-7","words":["verb:kallama"],"options":[{"bs":"govorio mu je","en":"he/it spoke to him"},{"bs":"govori im","en":"he/it speaks to them"},{"bs":"govori nam","en":"he/it speaks to us"},{"bs":"govori mu","en":"he/it speaks to him"}],"ref":"12:54","answerWord":"كَلَّمَهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/469d6caef0f187edc292.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And the king said: Bring him unto me that I may attach him to my person. And when he had talked with him he said: Lo! thou art to-day in our presence established and trusted.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"govoriti, obratiti se","en":"to speak to"},"passage":["وَقَالَ","ٱلْمَلِكُ","ٱئْتُونِى","بِهِۦٓ","أَسْتَخْلِصْهُ","لِنَفْسِى","فَلَمَّا","كَلَّمَهُۥ","قَالَ","إِنَّكَ","ٱلْيَوْمَ","لَدَيْنَا","مَكِينٌ","أَمِينٌ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"كَلَّمَ"}},{"id":"kallama-19-26-15","words":["verb:kallama"],"options":[{"bs":"govorim","en":"I speak"},{"bs":"govorio je","en":"he/it spoke"},{"bs":"oslovljen je","en":"he/it was spoken to"},{"bs":"govori im","en":"he/it speaks to them"}],"ref":"19:26","answerWord":"أُكَلِّمَ","answerSound":"audio/824d9f96c4446497132b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So eat and drink and be consoled. And if thou meetest any mortal, say: Lo! I have vowed a fast unto the Beneficent, and may not speak this day to any mortal.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"govoriti, obratiti se","en":"to speak to"},"passage":["فَكُلِى","وَٱشْرَبِى","وَقَرِّى","عَيْنًا","فَإِمَّا","تَرَيِنَّ","مِنَ","ٱلْبَشَرِ","أَحَدًا","فَقُولِىٓ","إِنِّى","نَذَرْتُ","لِلرَّحْمَٰنِ","صَوْمًا","فَلَنْ","أُكَلِّمَ","ٱلْيَوْمَ","إِنسِيًّا"],"marked":[15],"facts":{"verb":"كَلَّمَ"}},{"id":"kallama-19-29-4","words":["verb:kallama"],"options":[{"bs":"govorimo","en":"we speak"},{"bs":"govori im","en":"he/it speaks to them"},{"bs":"govorio je","en":"he/it spoke"},{"bs":"oslovljen je","en":"he/it was spoken to"}],"ref":"19:29","answerWord":"نُكَلِّمُ","answerSound":"audio/14ffc25483bce3499234.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then she pointed to him. They said: How can we talk to one who is in the cradle, a young boy?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"govoriti, obratiti se","en":"to speak to"},"passage":["فَأَشَارَتْ","إِلَيْهِ","قَالُوا۟","كَيْفَ","نُكَلِّمُ","مَن","كَانَ","فِى","ٱلْمَهْدِ","صَبِيًّا"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"كَلَّمَ"}},{"id":"kallama-23-108-4","words":["verb:kallama"],"options":[{"bs":"obraćajte Mi se","en":"speak to Me"},{"bs":"i govorio je","en":"and he/it spoke"},{"bs":"i govorio im je","en":"and he/it spoke to them"},{"bs":"govorim","en":"I speak"}],"ref":"23:108","answerWord":"تُكَلِّمُونِ","answerSound":"audio/c6e5698d5d7e6d5e36dd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He saith: Begone therein, and speak not unto Me.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"govoriti, obratiti se","en":"to speak to"},"passage":["قَالَ","ٱخْسَـُٔوا۟","فِيهَا","وَلَا","تُكَلِّمُونِ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"كَلَّمَ"}},{"id":"kallama-42-51-4","words":["verb:kallama"],"options":[{"bs":"govori mu","en":"he/it speaks to him"},{"bs":"govorim","en":"I speak"},{"bs":"govorio je","en":"he/it spoke"},{"bs":"govorio mu je","en":"he/it spoke to him"}],"ref":"42:51","answerWord":"يُكَلِّمَهُ","answerSound":"audio/2e722ea35898044fb26e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And it was not (vouchsafed) to any mortal that Allah should speak to him unless (it be) by revelation or from behind a veil, or (that) He sendeth a messenger to reveal what He will by His leave. Lo! He is Exalted, Wise.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"govoriti, obratiti se","en":"to speak to"},"passage":["وَمَا","كَانَ","لِبَشَرٍ","أَن","يُكَلِّمَهُ","ٱللَّهُ","إِلَّا","وَحْيًا","أَوْ","مِن","وَرَآئِ","حِجَابٍ","أَوْ","يُرْسِلَ","رَسُولًا","فَيُوحِىَ","بِإِذْنِهِۦ","مَا","يَشَآءُ","إِنَّهُۥ","عَلِىٌّ","حَكِيمٌ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"كَلَّمَ"}},{"id":"adha-33-58-1","words":["verb:adha"],"options":[{"bs":"uznemiravaju","en":"they harm"},{"bs":"uznemirili su","en":"they harmed"},{"bs":"uznemiravaju se","en":"they are harmed"},{"bs":"uznemiravate me","en":"you (all) harm me"}],"ref":"33:58","answerWord":"يُؤْذُونَ","answerSound":"audio/040b4ba7a1f0bc0c34d4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And those who malign believing men and believing women undeservedly, they bear the guilt of slander and manifest sin.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"uznemiriti, nauditi","en":"to harm, to hurt"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","يُؤْذُونَ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","وَٱلْمُؤْمِنَٰتِ","بِغَيْرِ","مَا","ٱكْتَسَبُوا۟","فَقَدِ","ٱحْتَمَلُوا۟","بُهْتَٰنًا","وَإِثْمًا","مُّبِينًا"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"آذَى"}},{"id":"adha-4-16-3","words":["verb:adha"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ih kaznite!","en":"so (you all) punish them (two)!"},{"bs":"uznemiravate","en":"you (all) harm"},{"bs":"uznemirili su","en":"they harmed"},{"bs":"uznemirili ste nas","en":"you (all) harmed us"}],"ref":"4:16","answerWord":"فَـَٔاذُوهُمَا","answerSound":"audio/1547f441d514d0fb4a82.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And as for the two of you who are guilty thereof, punish them both. And if they repent and improve, then let them be. Lo! Allah is ever relenting, Merciful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"uznemiriti, nauditi","en":"to harm, to hurt"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذَانِ","يَأْتِيَٰنِهَا","مِنكُمْ","فَـَٔاذُوهُمَا","فَإِن","تَابَا","وَأَصْلَحَا","فَأَعْرِضُوا۟","عَنْهُمَآ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","كَانَ","تَوَّابًا","رَّحِيمًا"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"آذَى"}},{"id":"adha-7-129-1","words":["verb:adha"],"options":[{"bs":"uznemireni smo","en":"we were harmed"},{"bs":"uznemiravaju se","en":"they are harmed"},{"bs":"i uznemireni su","en":"and they were harmed"},{"bs":"uznemirava","en":"he/it harms"}],"ref":"7:129","answerWord":"أُوذِينَا","answerSound":"audio/6ea2d0a7cdab6dd176f2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They said: We suffered hurt before thou camest unto us, and since thou hast come unto us. He said: It may be that your Lord is going to destroy your adversary and make you viceroys in the earth, that He may see how ye behave.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"uznemiriti, nauditi","en":"to harm, to hurt"},"passage":["قَالُوٓا۟","أُوذِينَا","مِن","قَبْلِ","أَن","تَأْتِيَنَا","وَمِنۢ","بَعْدِ","مَا","جِئْتَنَا","قَالَ","عَسَىٰ","رَبُّكُمْ","أَن","يُهْلِكَ","عَدُوَّكُمْ","وَيَسْتَخْلِفَكُمْ","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","فَيَنظُرَ","كَيْفَ","تَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"آذَى"}},{"id":"adha-14-12-12","words":["verb:adha"],"options":[{"bs":"uznemirili ste nas","en":"you (all) harmed us"},{"bs":"povrijeđen je","en":"he/it was harmed"},{"bs":"uznemiravate me","en":"you (all) harm me"},{"bs":"uznemirili su","en":"they harmed"}],"ref":"14:12","answerWord":"ءَاذَيْتُمُونَا","answerSound":"audio/530d6970e185b00d0842.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"How should we not put our trust in Allah when He hath shown us our ways? We surely will endure the hurt ye do us. In Allah let the trusting put their trust.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"uznemiriti, nauditi","en":"to harm, to hurt"},"passage":["وَمَا","لَنَآ","أَلَّا","نَتَوَكَّلَ","عَلَى","ٱللَّهِ","وَقَدْ","هَدَىٰنَا","سُبُلَنَا","وَلَنَصْبِرَنَّ","عَلَىٰ","مَآ","ءَاذَيْتُمُونَا","وَعَلَى","ٱللَّهِ","فَلْيَتَوَكَّلِ","ٱلْمُتَوَكِّلُونَ"],"marked":[12],"facts":{"verb":"آذَى"}},{"id":"adha-33-59-16","words":["verb:adha"],"options":[{"bs":"uznemiravaju se","en":"they are harmed"},{"bs":"uznemirava","en":"he/it harms"},{"bs":"uznemiravate me","en":"you (all) harm me"},{"bs":"uznemirili su","en":"they harmed"}],"ref":"33:59","answerWord":"يُؤْذَيْنَ","answerSound":"audio/f46a94545b5dabdd22bf.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O Prophet! Tell thy wives and thy daughters and the women of the believers to draw their cloaks close round them (when they go abroad). That will be better, so that they may be recognised and not annoyed. Allah is ever Forgiving, Merciful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"uznemiriti, nauditi","en":"to harm, to hurt"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلنَّبِىُّ","قُل","لِّأَزْوَٰجِكَ","وَبَنَاتِكَ","وَنِسَآءِ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","يُدْنِينَ","عَلَيْهِنَّ","مِن","جَلَٰبِيبِهِنَّ","ذَٰلِكَ","أَدْنَىٰٓ","أَن","يُعْرَفْنَ","فَلَا","يُؤْذَيْنَ","وَكَانَ","ٱللَّهُ","غَفُورًا","رَّحِيمًا"],"marked":[16],"facts":{"verb":"آذَى"}},{"id":"adha-33-69-6","words":["verb:adha"],"options":[{"bs":"uznemirili su","en":"they harmed"},{"bs":"uznemiravate","en":"you (all) harm"},{"bs":"uznemiravaju","en":"they harm"},{"bs":"uznemiravate me","en":"you (all) harm me"}],"ref":"33:69","answerWord":"ءَاذَوْا۟","answerSound":"audio/a4b7f8b949860a65c0b6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! Be not as those who slandered Moses, but Allah proved his innocence of that which they alleged, and he was well esteemed in Allah's sight.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"uznemiriti, nauditi","en":"to harm, to hurt"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","لَا","تَكُونُوا۟","كَٱلَّذِينَ","ءَاذَوْا۟","مُوسَىٰ","فَبَرَّأَهُ","ٱللَّهُ","مِمَّا","قَالُوا۟","وَكَانَ","عِندَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَجِيهًا"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"آذَى"}},{"id":"adha-61-5-6","words":["verb:adha"],"options":[{"bs":"uznemiravate me","en":"you (all) harm me"},{"bs":"uznemireni smo","en":"we were harmed"},{"bs":"pa ih kaznite!","en":"so (you all) punish them (two)!"},{"bs":"uznemirili su","en":"they harmed"}],"ref":"61:5","answerWord":"تُؤْذُونَنِى","answerSound":"audio/53f48ef2446904974826.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (remember) when Moses said unto his people: O my people! Why persecute ye me, when ye well know that I am Allah's messenger unto you? So when they went astray Allah sent their hearts astray. And Allah guideth not the evil-living folk.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"uznemiriti, nauditi","en":"to harm, to hurt"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","قَالَ","مُوسَىٰ","لِقَوْمِهِۦ","يَٰقَوْمِ","لِمَ","تُؤْذُونَنِى","وَقَد","تَّعْلَمُونَ","أَنِّى","رَسُولُ","ٱللَّهِ","إِلَيْكُمْ","فَلَمَّا","زَاغُوٓا۟","أَزَاغَ","ٱللَّهُ","قُلُوبَهُمْ","وَٱللَّهُ","لَا","يَهْدِى","ٱلْقَوْمَ","ٱلْفَٰسِقِينَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"آذَى"}},{"id":"anaba-40-13-13","words":["verb:anaba"],"options":[{"bs":"obraća se","en":"he/it turns (in repentance)"},{"bs":"obratili smo se","en":"we turned (in repentance)"},{"bs":"i obratite se!","en":"and (you all) turn (in repentance)!"},{"bs":"obraćam se","en":"I turn (in repentance)"}],"ref":"40:13","answerWord":"يُنِيبُ","answerSound":"audio/5df437f009fed34e955e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He it is Who showeth you His portents, and sendeth down for you provision from the sky. None payeth heed save him who turneth (unto Him) repentant.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"obratiti se (s pokajanjem), opunomoćiti","en":"to turn (in repentance), to deputize"},"passage":["هُوَ","ٱلَّذِى","يُرِيكُمْ","ءَايَٰتِهِۦ","وَيُنَزِّلُ","لَكُم","مِّنَ","ٱلسَّمَآءِ","رِزْقًا","وَمَا","يَتَذَكَّرُ","إِلَّا","مَن","يُنِيبُ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"أَنابَ"}},{"id":"anaba-39-17-5","words":["verb:anaba"],"options":[{"bs":"i obratili su se","en":"and they turned (in repentance)"},{"bs":"obraćam se","en":"I turn (in repentance)"},{"bs":"obraća se","en":"he/it turns (in repentance)"},{"bs":"i obratio se","en":"and he/it turned (in repentance)"}],"ref":"39:17","answerWord":"وَأَنَابُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/afadb811fffb9051023b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And those who put away false gods lest they should worship them and turn to Allah in repentance, for them there are glad tidings. Therefor give good tidings (O Muhammad) to My bondmen","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"obratiti se (s pokajanjem), opunomoćiti","en":"to turn (in repentance), to deputize"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","ٱجْتَنَبُوا۟","ٱلطَّٰغُوتَ","أَن","يَعْبُدُوهَا","وَأَنَابُوٓا۟","إِلَى","ٱللَّهِ","لَهُمُ","ٱلْبُشْرَىٰ","فَبَشِّرْ","عِبَادِ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"أَنابَ"}},{"id":"anaba-39-54-0","words":["verb:anaba"],"options":[{"bs":"i obratite se!","en":"and (you all) turn (in repentance)!"},{"bs":"i obratio se","en":"and he/it turned (in repentance)"},{"bs":"obratili smo se","en":"we turned (in repentance)"},{"bs":"i obratili su se","en":"and they turned (in repentance)"}],"ref":"39:54","answerWord":"وَأَنِيبُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/337d27cabac7b394c7db.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Turn unto your Lord repentant, and surrender unto Him, before there come unto you the doom, when ye cannot be helped.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"obratiti se (s pokajanjem), opunomoćiti","en":"to turn (in repentance), to deputize"},"passage":["وَأَنِيبُوٓا۟","إِلَىٰ","رَبِّكُمْ","وَأَسْلِمُوا۟","لَهُۥ","مِن","قَبْلِ","أَن","يَأْتِيَكُمُ","ٱلْعَذَابُ","ثُمَّ","لَا","تُنصَرُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"أَنابَ"}},{"id":"iftada-3-91-14","words":["verb:iftada"],"options":[{"bs":"otkupio je","en":"he/it ransomed"},{"bs":"da otkupe","en":"so that they may ransom"},{"bs":"otkupio bi se","en":"he could ransom himself"},{"bs":"otkupila je","en":"she/it ransomed"}],"ref":"3:91","answerWord":"ٱفْتَدَىٰ","answerSound":"audio/18f88b709d409f632c17.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! those who disbelieve, and die in disbelief, the (whole) earth full of gold would not be accepted from such an one if it were offered as a ransom (for his soul). Theirs will be a painful doom and they will have no helpers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"otkupiti","en":"to ransom"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","وَمَاتُوا۟","وَهُمْ","كُفَّارٌ","فَلَن","يُقْبَلَ","مِنْ","أَحَدِهِم","مِّلْءُ","ٱلْأَرْضِ","ذَهَبًا","وَلَوِ","ٱفْتَدَىٰ","بِهِۦٓ","أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","لَهُمْ","عَذَابٌ","أَلِيمٌ","وَمَا","لَهُم","مِّن","نَّٰصِرِينَ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"افْتَدَى"}},{"id":"iftada-5-36-12","words":["verb:iftada"],"options":[{"bs":"da otkupe","en":"so that they may ransom"},{"bs":"otkupio bi se","en":"he could ransom himself"},{"bs":"otkupio je","en":"he/it ransomed"},{"bs":"otkupila je","en":"she/it ransomed"}],"ref":"5:36","answerWord":"لِيَفْتَدُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/918d59b258b7a548580d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"As for those who disbelieve, lo! if all that is in the earth were theirs, and as much again therewith, to ransom them from the doom on the Day of Resurrection, it would not be accepted from them. Theirs will be a painful doom.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"otkupiti","en":"to ransom"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","لَوْ","أَنَّ","لَهُم","مَّا","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","جَمِيعًا","وَمِثْلَهُۥ","مَعَهُۥ","لِيَفْتَدُوا۟","بِهِۦ","مِنْ","عَذَابِ","يَوْمِ","ٱلْقِيَٰمَةِ","مَا","تُقُبِّلَ","مِنْهُمْ","وَلَهُمْ","عَذَابٌ","أَلِيمٌ"],"marked":[12],"facts":{"verb":"افْتَدَى"}},{"id":"iftada-70-11-4","words":["verb:iftada"],"options":[{"bs":"otkupio bi se","en":"he could ransom himself"},{"bs":"otkupio je","en":"he/it ransomed"},{"bs":"otkupila je","en":"she/it ransomed"},{"bs":"da otkupe","en":"so that they may ransom"}],"ref":"70:11","answerWord":"يَفْتَدِى","answerSound":"audio/223a29de96cd294ca2f3.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Though they will be given sight of them. The guilty man will long to be able to ransom himself from the punishment of that day at the price of his children","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"otkupiti","en":"to ransom"},"passage":["يُبَصَّرُونَهُمْ","يَوَدُّ","ٱلْمُجْرِمُ","لَوْ","يَفْتَدِى","مِنْ","عَذَابِ","يَوْمِئِذٍۭ","بِبَنِيهِ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"افْتَدَى"}},{"id":"anbaa-2-31-9","words":["verb:anbaa"],"options":[{"bs":"obavijestite me!","en":"(you all) inform me!"},{"bs":"obavijestio te je","en":"he/it informed you"},{"bs":"obavijesti ih!","en":"inform them!"},{"bs":"obavijestio ih je","en":"he/it informed them"}],"ref":"2:31","answerWord":"أَنۢبِـُٔونِى","answerSound":"audio/02c7b295bdbc9bfe9e44.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And He taught Adam all the names, then showed them to the angels, saying: Inform Me of the names of these, if ye are truthful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"obavijestiti","en":"to inform, to tell"},"passage":["وَعَلَّمَ","ءَادَمَ","ٱلْأَسْمَآءَ","كُلَّهَا","ثُمَّ","عَرَضَهُمْ","عَلَى","ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةِ","فَقَالَ","أَنۢبِـُٔونِى","بِأَسْمَآءِ","هَٰٓؤُلَآءِ","إِن","كُنتُمْ","صَٰدِقِينَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"أَنْبَأَ"}},{"id":"anbaa-2-33-2","words":["verb:anbaa"],"options":[{"bs":"obavijesti ih!","en":"inform them!"},{"bs":"obavijestio te je","en":"he/it informed you"},{"bs":"obavijestio ih je","en":"he/it informed them"},{"bs":"obavijestite me!","en":"(you all) inform me!"}],"ref":"2:33","answerWord":"أَنۢبِئْهُم","answerSound":"audio/b3a932b39d4fe450255e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: O Adam! Inform them of their names, and when he had informed them of their names, He said: Did I not tell you that I know the secret of the heavens and the earth? And I know that which ye disclose and which ye hide.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"obavijestiti","en":"to inform, to tell"},"passage":["قَالَ","يَٰٓـَٔادَمُ","أَنۢبِئْهُم","بِأَسْمَآئِهِمْ","فَلَمَّآ","أَنۢبَأَهُم","بِأَسْمَآئِهِمْ","قَالَ","أَلَمْ","أَقُل","لَّكُمْ","إِنِّىٓ","أَعْلَمُ","غَيْبَ","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلْأَرْضِ","وَأَعْلَمُ","مَا","تُبْدُونَ","وَمَا","كُنتُمْ","تَكْتُمُونَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَنْبَأَ"}},{"id":"anbaa-2-33-5","words":["verb:anbaa"],"options":[{"bs":"obavijestio ih je","en":"he/it informed them"},{"bs":"obavijesti ih!","en":"inform them!"},{"bs":"obavijestite me!","en":"(you all) inform me!"},{"bs":"obavijestio te je","en":"he/it informed you"}],"ref":"2:33","answerWord":"أَنۢبَأَهُم","answerSound":"audio/ed350490098f06b9f58b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: O Adam! Inform them of their names, and when he had informed them of their names, He said: Did I not tell you that I know the secret of the heavens and the earth? And I know that which ye disclose and which ye hide.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"obavijestiti","en":"to inform, to tell"},"passage":["قَالَ","يَٰٓـَٔادَمُ","أَنۢبِئْهُم","بِأَسْمَآئِهِمْ","فَلَمَّآ","أَنۢبَأَهُم","بِأَسْمَآئِهِمْ","قَالَ","أَلَمْ","أَقُل","لَّكُمْ","إِنِّىٓ","أَعْلَمُ","غَيْبَ","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلْأَرْضِ","وَأَعْلَمُ","مَا","تُبْدُونَ","وَمَا","كُنتُمْ","تَكْتُمُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"أَنْبَأَ"}},{"id":"anbaa-66-3-23","words":["verb:anbaa"],"options":[{"bs":"obavijestio te je","en":"he/it informed you"},{"bs":"obavijestite me!","en":"(you all) inform me!"},{"bs":"obavijesti ih!","en":"inform them!"},{"bs":"obavijestio ih je","en":"he/it informed them"}],"ref":"66:3","answerWord":"أَنۢبَأَكَ","answerSound":"audio/40e731cb0de699600127.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"When the Prophet confided a fact unto one of his wives and when she afterward divulged it and Allah apprised him thereof, he made known (to her) part thereof and passed over part. And when he told it her she said: Who hath told thee? He said: The Knower, the Aware hath told me.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"obavijestiti","en":"to inform, to tell"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","أَسَرَّ","ٱلنَّبِىُّ","إِلَىٰ","بَعْضِ","أَزْوَٰجِهِۦ","حَدِيثًا","فَلَمَّا","نَبَّأَتْ","بِهِۦ","وَأَظْهَرَهُ","ٱللَّهُ","عَلَيْهِ","عَرَّفَ","بَعْضَهُۥ","وَأَعْرَضَ","عَنۢ","بَعْضٍ","فَلَمَّا","نَبَّأَهَا","بِهِۦ","قَالَتْ","مَنْ","أَنۢبَأَكَ","هَٰذَا","قَالَ","نَبَّأَنِىَ","ٱلْعَلِيمُ","ٱلْخَبِيرُ"],"marked":[23],"facts":{"verb":"أَنْبَأَ"}},{"id":"tanaja-58-9-4","words":["verb:tanaja"],"options":[{"bs":"došaptavali ste se","en":"you (all) conversed privately"},{"bs":"i došaptavaju se","en":"and they converse privately"},{"bs":"došaptavate se","en":"you (all) converse privately"},{"bs":"i došaptavajte se!","en":"and (you all) converse privately!"}],"ref":"58:9","answerWord":"تَنَٰجَيْتُمْ","answerSound":"audio/0c5af8120f9e9ce7c31b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! When ye conspire together, conspire not together for crime and wrongdoing and disobedience toward the messenger, but conspire together for righteousness and piety, and keep your duty toward Allah, unto whom ye will be gathered.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"tajno razgovarati, šaputati se","en":"to converse privately"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوٓا۟","إِذَا","تَنَٰجَيْتُمْ","فَلَا","تَتَنَٰجَوْا۟","بِٱلْإِثْمِ","وَٱلْعُدْوَٰنِ","وَمَعْصِيَتِ","ٱلرَّسُولِ","وَتَنَٰجَوْا۟","بِٱلْبِرِّ","وَٱلتَّقْوَىٰ","وَٱتَّقُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","ٱلَّذِىٓ","إِلَيْهِ","تُحْشَرُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"تَنَاجَى"}},{"id":"tanaja-58-9-6","words":["verb:tanaja"],"options":[{"bs":"došaptavate se","en":"you (all) converse privately"},{"bs":"došaptavali ste se","en":"you (all) conversed privately"},{"bs":"i došaptavajte se!","en":"and (you all) converse privately!"},{"bs":"i došaptavaju se","en":"and they converse privately"}],"ref":"58:9","answerWord":"تَتَنَٰجَوْا۟","answerSound":"audio/4ece54859dd0ecf67ae4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! When ye conspire together, conspire not together for crime and wrongdoing and disobedience toward the messenger, but conspire together for righteousness and piety, and keep your duty toward Allah, unto whom ye will be gathered.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"tajno razgovarati, šaputati se","en":"to converse privately"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوٓا۟","إِذَا","تَنَٰجَيْتُمْ","فَلَا","تَتَنَٰجَوْا۟","بِٱلْإِثْمِ","وَٱلْعُدْوَٰنِ","وَمَعْصِيَتِ","ٱلرَّسُولِ","وَتَنَٰجَوْا۟","بِٱلْبِرِّ","وَٱلتَّقْوَىٰ","وَٱتَّقُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","ٱلَّذِىٓ","إِلَيْهِ","تُحْشَرُونَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"تَنَاجَى"}}]